      "description": "Capitalized navigation with the active item in Leaf Green and a two-pixel underline.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Portfolio\"><button class=\"ds-nav-item ds-nav-active\" type=\"button\" aria-current=\"page\">Home</button><button class=\"ds-nav-item\" type=\"button\">About</button><button class=\"ds-nav-item\" type=\"button\">My Projects</button><button class=\"ds-nav-item\" type=\"button\">Contact</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:40px}.ds-nav-item{position:relative;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;color:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:18px;line-height:28px;font-weight:500;text-transform:capitalize;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;transition:color 300ms}.ds-nav-item:hover{color:hsl(var(--primary, 142.1 76.2% 36.3%) / 0.6)}.ds-nav-item:focus-visible{outline:auto 1px}.ds-nav-active{color:hsl(var(--primary, 142.1 76.2% 36.3%))}.ds-nav-active::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;height:2px;background:hsl(var(--primary, 142.1 76.2% 36.3%))}"
